ILY: 돋움,dotum\"> </span></div><div style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND-COLOR: white\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: white\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum\">❍ 주</span><span lang=\"en-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum\">최 </span><span lang=\"en-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum\">:&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum\">한국보건산업진흥원</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum\"> </span></div><div style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: white\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum\">❍ 주</span><span lang=\"en-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;관</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum\"> </span><span lang=\"en-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum\">:&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum\">BIO KOREA Organizing Committee</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum\"> </span></div><div style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: white\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: white\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum\">❍&nbsp;후&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 원&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"en-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum\">:&nbsp; 보건복지부, 한국제약바이오협회, 한국의료기기공업협동조합, 한국글로벌의약산업협회,</span></span></span></div><div style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: white\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: white\"><span lang=\"en-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;한국건강기능식품협회, 대한화장품협회</span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,dotum\"> </span></div><div style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MA